  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="codex">
        <pb n="1" facs="#f01" />
        <div n="1" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f01-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">南華醫院考試醫生。○本日總理協董駢車</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f01-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">到院恭向醫祖先師案前投筊拈題與試者計四十</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f01-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">七名題係問心經有熱水不剋火驚狂失志多言多</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f01-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">笑或瘍疹煩熱失血請將病原脉症治法藥性詳明</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f01-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">論試竣將卷包封遞寄香港東華醫院評定甲乙然</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f01-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">異日如意珠未知握於誰手也</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：報紙本埠欄，首行報題止於小句點，隨空圈續正文，六欄由右向左。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="2" facs="#f02" />
        <div n="2" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f02-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">醫師中選○日前南華醫院諸董公同拈題</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f02-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">考試醫生維時與試者計四十七名已將各卷彙齊</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f02-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">包封遞到粵省廣仁善堂評閱茲已評定甲乙拔其</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f02-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">尤者十名其前二名卽連鏡堂鄒伯謙均蒙南華醫</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f02-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">院錄用至于各卷容後續錄</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：檳城新報第3070號本埠欄，跨同一版的兩橫欄，讀上排最左二直欄，換中排最右三直欄。末續錄後另起報文。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
